@startuml 图2-7 序列图：查询个人积分与流水（UC-06 用例实现）
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "市民" as U
participant "前端\n(PointsPage)" as FE
participant "Router + 中间件" as API
participant "PointsHandler\n(httpserver/points.go)" as H
database "MySQL\npoint_account / point_txn" as DB

U -> FE : 打开积分页
FE -> API : GET /api/v1/points/summary
API -> H : Summary(userID)
H -> DB : SELECT balance, frozen, total_saved_g\nFROM point_account WHERE user_id = ?
DB --> H : account
H --> API : 200 {balance, frozen, totalSavedG}
API --> FE : 汇总

FE -> API : GET /api/v1/points/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
API -> H : ListTxns(userID, page)
H -> DB : SELECT ... FROM point_txn\nWHERE account_id = ? ORDER BY occurred_at DESC\nLIMIT ? OFFSET ?
DB --> H : rows + total
H --> API : 200 {items, total, page}
API --> FE : 流水分页
FE --> U : 余额 / 累计减碳 / 流水列表

note over H
  分页参数在 handler 兜底：page < 1 归 1，
  pageSize 超上限截断；未登录由中间件先拦 401。
end note
@enduml
